#!/nodejs/bin/node
// Git runs this before it accepts a push (core.hooksPath, build plan §2.5).
// Until Shinan's push checks exist (GC-3a), it refuses every push, so
// nothing unchecked can land. Plain JavaScript that runs as a CommonJS or
// an ES module: Node.js starts it directly, without a shell.
